<title>BELGIUM: NMKN-SNCI TO LOWER INVESTMENT CREDIT RATES.</title>
<headline>NMKN-SNCI TO LOWER INVESTMENT CREDIT RATES.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian industrial investment</p>
<p>credit bank NMKN-SNCI said on Friday it would cut interest rates</p>
<p>on investment credits from April 28 as follows:</p>
<p>    MATURITY			NEW RATE	CHANGE</p>
<p>    three-year revisable	5.70 pct	 -25 bps</p>
<p>    five-year revisable	 6.50 pct	 -20 bps</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
